WEBVTT

00:19.460 --> 00:21.170
All troops, charge!

00:21.170 --> 00:25.000
Kill every last one of those inferiors!

00:25.500 --> 00:28.670
You know, they told me to surrender.

00:29.290 --> 00:32.630
I will throw those exact words
right back in their faces.

00:33.170 --> 00:39.170
All those bastards can do is grovel at
the feet of the 5,000-strong Daydream Unit.

00:42.000 --> 00:43.420
Foolish.

00:43.420 --> 00:44.500
What?

00:44.500 --> 00:50.080
A squadron built by violence, fear,
and the like are nothing more than riffraff.

00:50.080 --> 00:53.000
Well, there's no point in saying that.

00:53.330 --> 00:58.080
In any case, We have come here
to watch you die.

00:58.080 --> 00:59.670
Stop your lies.

00:59.670 --> 01:02.170
I hear nothing but
a loser wasting her breath.

01:02.170 --> 01:04.710
Good evening to viewers all over the world!

01:05.750 --> 01:08.540
Melca Tiano from Six Nation News here!

01:08.540 --> 01:11.880
This is the first time we're attempting
an endeavor like this so I'm nervous,

01:11.880 --> 01:14.250
but there's something I want to tell you all!

01:15.000 --> 01:18.750
Rather than telling you about the
actual darkness of Gerra-Aruka,

01:18.750 --> 01:21.380
it's faster to have you take a look at
what's actually happening.

01:21.380 --> 01:24.500
Just take a look at the
number of people in this prison!

01:24.500 --> 01:27.290
This place is below Gerra-Aruka's
Daydream Paradise!

01:27.290 --> 01:31.420
There aren't only sympathizers of the
Arukan royal family imprisoned here!

01:31.420 --> 01:34.630
Various clans from other countries
have been wrongfully captured,

01:34.630 --> 01:37.960
and have become victims of cruel
living-body experimentations!

01:40.210 --> 01:42.420
Eek! Miss Melca,
let's get outta here already!

01:42.420 --> 01:44.080
This is gonna get us killed!

01:44.080 --> 01:45.580
So what if we're killed?!

01:45.580 --> 01:47.630
If the battlefield is where I die,
then I've lived my purpose!

01:47.630 --> 01:51.500
Please start thinking like a journalist
and not a soldier!

01:51.830 --> 01:54.540
These actions are clearly inhumane!

01:54.540 --> 01:58.330
Also, President Madhart, who has
taken the lead in these atrocities,

01:58.330 --> 02:01.880
is trying to move an army of 5,000
to launch an attack on Faure!

02:01.880 --> 02:05.460
Can you just stand by as the world
is ruled by evil like this?!

02:05.460 --> 02:07.290
Of course we can't.

02:15.920 --> 02:19.080
This is your Core Implosion...

02:19.750 --> 02:20.790
Yes.

02:23.330 --> 02:25.330
"Diverse Divide."

02:25.710 --> 02:29.500
My blade will slice and sever
all that is evil!

02:30.130 --> 02:34.790
<b>A Golden World</b>

02:32.380 --> 02:34.790
Everyone! I've come to save you!

02:35.080 --> 02:36.630
Now, go!

02:36.630 --> 02:38.960
I will rise so I can change Aruka!

02:39.790 --> 02:42.710
Lady Nelia is finally taking a stand!

02:44.630 --> 02:46.960
This is the end for Madhart!

02:49.250 --> 02:53.080
I'm going to change Aruka, no matter what!

02:55.920 --> 02:57.210
Lady Nelia...

02:57.210 --> 02:59.670
Doing this is a waste, and yet...

02:59.670 --> 03:00.500
Why...?

03:00.500 --> 03:01.670
Gertrude!

03:06.080 --> 03:07.630
Lady Nelia...

03:07.880 --> 03:09.790
You are my servant!

03:09.790 --> 03:12.540
Maids that defy their masters
will be punished!

03:12.540 --> 03:13.670
You've got it wrong!

03:13.670 --> 03:16.750
I did all of this for you!

03:21.960 --> 03:23.750
You're just a maid...

03:26.670 --> 03:33.420
You will not defy me!

03:47.630 --> 03:50.420
What did you want me to do?

03:52.170 --> 03:54.500
You can't beat Madhart.

03:55.080 --> 03:59.500
That man is a hero in a very bad way!

04:00.040 --> 04:06.710
That's why I didn't want you to get
even more hurt than you are, Lady Nelia!

04:07.080 --> 04:10.170
You're Rainsworth's younger sister, yeah?

04:10.630 --> 04:13.920
I thought you couldn't care less
about what happens to me.

04:14.710 --> 04:16.460
That isn't true!

04:17.460 --> 04:21.080
I... have been abused by my brother.

04:22.250 --> 04:25.380
He says my life has no worth
if I'm not strong.

04:25.380 --> 04:30.380
You treated me with so much care!

04:31.710 --> 04:35.250
You worried when I got hurt,

04:35.250 --> 04:38.540
and you celebrated my birthday, too.

04:41.420 --> 04:48.170
So, I thought you should forget
all your suffering and live in peace.

04:49.630 --> 04:52.000
My brother is human trash,

04:52.000 --> 04:55.540
but since you're someone
he'd cherish as his own...

04:56.130 --> 04:59.380
If you call living like someone else's
pet "peace", then I don't want it.

04:59.380 --> 05:01.000
I'm sorry.

05:02.960 --> 05:05.330
Thank you for everything up until now.

05:05.330 --> 05:07.920
Please forget I exist.

05:08.170 --> 05:10.290
You were at a rebellious age.

05:10.540 --> 05:11.380
Huh?

05:11.380 --> 05:14.080
I'm not going to find fault
with every little thing

05:14.080 --> 05:16.670
just because one of my servants
snapped at me.

05:16.670 --> 05:19.330
However, if there's something I'm doing
that you're not satisfied with,

05:19.330 --> 05:20.500
say something.

05:20.500 --> 05:23.040
A one-sided relationship
isn't good, you know.

05:23.040 --> 05:24.420
Lady Nelia...

05:25.500 --> 05:29.420
Okay! I'm your number one servant!

05:29.750 --> 05:32.210
Miss Komari, Miss Cunningham.

05:32.710 --> 05:33.830
Karla!

05:33.830 --> 05:37.630
What? I'm planning to go
after Rainsworth next.

05:37.630 --> 05:40.330
Our enemies are a 5,000 troop army.

05:40.330 --> 05:43.790
If you head out alone,
it's a no-win situation.

05:43.790 --> 05:46.080
I'm fighting, even if I have no chance.

05:46.080 --> 05:48.000
That is my duty here.

05:48.540 --> 05:51.580
Even if you went on a suicide mission
on a mount, you'd just die in vain.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.630
Why don't we come up with a strategy first?

05:53.630 --> 05:55.250
But aren't you one of

05:55.250 --> 05:58.080
the Five Imperial Sabers who can
destroy the universe?

05:58.080 --> 06:00.670
Yes, this is true.

06:00.670 --> 06:03.500
Let's talk strategy, so we can make
absolutely sure of everything.

06:03.880 --> 06:05.540
What's with this space?

06:06.290 --> 06:10.130
But there is some sense in your suggestion.

06:10.880 --> 06:14.540
Considering the strength we have,
our enemy is excessively powerful...

06:15.210 --> 06:17.330
His crimes have been exposed,

06:17.330 --> 06:19.540
but none of that matters
if we lose due to our strength.

06:20.540 --> 06:22.210
In order to counter him,

06:22.210 --> 06:26.250
the entire world must come together
and stand against him.

06:28.380 --> 06:30.540
Komari, can I have a word?

06:30.540 --> 06:31.790
Wh-what is it?

06:31.790 --> 06:34.880
Miss Nelia, I still don't trust you.

06:34.880 --> 06:37.250
Stay away from Miss Komari.

06:37.250 --> 06:39.170
No need to be on guard.

06:39.170 --> 06:42.500
Komari and I are close enough
that we've shared blood.

06:42.500 --> 06:43.670
What?!

06:44.170 --> 06:45.630
I don't believe it...

06:45.630 --> 06:48.210
Did you make Lady Komari drink your blood?

06:48.210 --> 06:51.170
No, but Komari let me drink her blood.

06:51.170 --> 06:52.380
Oh dear...
No, but Komari let me drink her blood.<b></b>

06:53.290 --> 06:54.790
Could it be...?

06:59.630 --> 07:01.960
Wh-what are you doing?!

07:01.960 --> 07:05.580
This is my thanks to you.
I'll let you drink my blood.

07:05.580 --> 07:06.710
Blood?!

07:06.710 --> 07:08.670
Whoa, wait! I don't need to do that!

07:08.670 --> 07:11.170
Even though I got blood from you,

07:11.170 --> 07:14.040
I'm a little disappointed that you
won't drink my blood.

07:14.040 --> 07:16.420
I-it's the thought that counts.

07:16.420 --> 07:18.460
I'll have tomato juice instead.

07:18.460 --> 07:20.460
Now, that won't do.

07:21.170 --> 07:24.670
Komari, you have incredible power.

07:24.670 --> 07:26.710
You'll understand if you drink this blood.

07:26.710 --> 07:28.710
Easier said than done...

07:29.040 --> 07:31.540
My teacher is your mother.

07:31.540 --> 07:34.170
That means we're like sisters.

07:35.420 --> 07:39.000
Have a little faith in your big sister, okay?

07:39.920 --> 07:41.130
But...

07:41.790 --> 07:44.330
I can change the world with you.

07:44.330 --> 07:46.380
I feel like we can do it, right now.

07:52.460 --> 07:55.460
I won't forgive anyone
who hurts the people.

07:55.790 --> 07:58.710
The world doesn't belong solely to Madhart.

07:58.710 --> 08:00.670
It belongs to us all...

08:01.380 --> 08:02.540
Right.

08:03.750 --> 08:06.790
I'm not sure what I can do, but...

08:09.460 --> 08:11.880
I want to fight alongside you.

08:45.540 --> 08:47.130
What is that?

08:50.080 --> 08:52.920
Citizens of the world, have a look!

08:52.920 --> 08:56.710
Her Excellency Terakomari Gandesblood
is finally getting serious!

08:56.710 --> 08:59.330
She will save the world with that!

09:01.130 --> 09:02.790
Komarin! Komarin!

09:03.080 --> 09:04.750
Komarin! Komarin!

09:04.750 --> 09:08.500
Komarin! Komarin! Komarin! Komarin!

09:08.500 --> 09:10.670
Well then, Your Excellency Gandesblood!

09:10.670 --> 09:12.500
A boost of morale, please!

09:14.130 --> 09:16.960
I will demolish Gerra-Aruka.

09:37.790 --> 09:42.540
At least we bought some time...
for the citizens to escape.

09:43.210 --> 09:45.000
What a disgrace.

09:45.000 --> 09:48.210
I'm too ashamed to face Lady Karen.

10:01.630 --> 10:03.630
Millicent Bluenight.

10:06.420 --> 10:08.130
Poor things.

10:08.130 --> 10:10.210
I'll grant you death now.

10:10.920 --> 10:12.750
With that elementary-level magic?

10:15.420 --> 10:16.500
Huh?

10:19.790 --> 10:22.130
Let's go, 5th Unit.

10:22.130 --> 10:24.080
Put them out of their misery.

10:28.380 --> 10:29.710
I understand.

10:29.710 --> 10:32.920
Have you taken charge of the 5th Unit?

10:34.250 --> 10:36.420
Pain in the butt, though.

10:44.790 --> 10:46.630
Who the hell are you?!

10:46.790 --> 10:50.130
I was told to gain merit and
atone for my sins, but...

10:51.250 --> 10:53.790
if she comes out of this in the end,

10:53.790 --> 10:55.750
then there's no way I can give her credit.

10:55.750 --> 10:57.290
What are you saying?!

10:57.290 --> 10:59.040
And who the hell is that?!

11:00.040 --> 11:02.880
That girl I loathe.

11:04.080 --> 11:06.920
I don't mind killing you,

11:06.920 --> 11:09.830
but it may be more effective
if I let her do it.

11:10.630 --> 11:14.750
I'll let you off the hook
this time, Terakomari.

11:14.750 --> 11:17.040
H-hey! Wait right there!

11:29.130 --> 11:30.630
Rainsworth!

11:32.420 --> 11:34.420
Time to face the music!

11:34.790 --> 11:36.130
Stop acting so insolent!

11:36.130 --> 11:38.670
All you have to do is obey me!

11:38.670 --> 11:41.750
If you do, I promise you eternal happiness!

11:41.750 --> 11:43.080
No thanks.

11:43.380 --> 11:46.670
I'm happy to fight alongside Komari!

11:46.670 --> 11:49.290
You agree, right, Komari?

11:52.210 --> 11:53.670
Don't...

11:53.670 --> 11:57.420
Don't you look at others that way!

12:05.380 --> 12:06.670
Absurd...

12:06.830 --> 12:08.290
Absurd!

12:12.290 --> 12:16.040
People of the world who feel hatred and
pent-up resentment towards Gerra-Aruka!

12:16.040 --> 12:18.040
Now is the time for you to rise up!

12:18.040 --> 12:19.670
I sure am!

12:21.790 --> 12:23.710
For Aruka's revolution!

12:23.710 --> 12:25.630
Now is the time to rise up!

12:28.080 --> 12:30.750
Terkomari Gandesblood...

12:30.920 --> 12:33.670
You're sensing it too, aren't you?

12:33.670 --> 12:38.420
That girl is a vampire who will guide
the hearts of the people.

12:42.580 --> 12:46.000
Ah, this is surely the radiant glow
of a conqueror.

12:46.420 --> 12:51.250
Her Excellency is the strongest vampire
who will unite this world.

13:03.210 --> 13:05.460
I have a notification from the goddess.

13:05.460 --> 13:08.750
It says "Beat that Daydream Unit
to a bloody pulp."

13:08.750 --> 13:11.460
The mission is still on?

13:14.460 --> 13:15.830
Very well, then.

13:15.830 --> 13:21.170
My big brother Kakumei may be
watching my fighting from somewhere.

13:24.750 --> 13:25.830
What?

13:25.830 --> 13:27.920
Those fence-sitters from
the Enchanted Lands

13:27.920 --> 13:30.710
have declared war on Gerra-Aruka?!

13:33.130 --> 13:36.210
So, the only enemy here is Gerra-Aruka, huh!

13:36.210 --> 13:38.630
Nice and simple, I like it!

13:38.630 --> 13:41.380
Now then, my beloved soldiers!

13:42.500 --> 13:46.830
Blast the enemy full of holes
like a honeycomb!

13:47.290 --> 13:48.330
Nelia!

13:48.330 --> 13:50.580
You are venturing down the wrong path!

13:50.580 --> 13:53.960
You are acting against your own interests!

13:53.960 --> 13:56.170
Come back to me!

13:56.460 --> 13:58.460
And that's why I came back.

13:58.460 --> 14:00.460
I'm here to defeat you!

14:09.250 --> 14:10.920
What is this...

14:15.170 --> 14:16.460
Hey, Komari!

14:16.460 --> 14:18.830
This one is mine!

14:19.080 --> 14:22.210
You damn Warblades! Capture Nelia!

14:24.170 --> 14:27.170
Hey, you! Get outta my way!

14:28.960 --> 14:32.330
Core Implosion: "Adamant Steel!"

14:32.670 --> 14:33.710
Core Implosion?!

14:36.290 --> 14:40.130
Die, Terakomari Gandesblood!

14:40.540 --> 14:45.080
Something like that is no more
than confetti to my steel body!

14:56.250 --> 14:58.080
This can't... be real...

14:58.080 --> 14:59.170
It's real.

15:08.630 --> 15:13.880
How dare a mere member of
an inferior clan get so cocky!

15:14.040 --> 15:15.460
Give up.

15:17.830 --> 15:19.920
You are in the wrong.

15:20.330 --> 15:24.540
There's no such thing as being wrong!

15:40.710 --> 15:42.750
Gerra-Aruka will fall.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.290
Nelia...

15:52.500 --> 15:56.210
My homeland was sold to another
country by the King of Aruka,

15:56.210 --> 15:59.170
who preaches pacifism and all that.

15:59.750 --> 16:02.380
While protecting my younger sister,

16:02.380 --> 16:05.210
I did my absolute best to put up
with the discrimination.

16:06.580 --> 16:10.170
While putting up with it all,
my desire for revenge burned.

16:10.170 --> 16:12.670
I wanted revenge on the
other clans that tormented us,

16:12.670 --> 16:16.080
and the cowardly Arukan royals.

16:19.330 --> 16:23.290
To execute that revenge,
all I could do was get stronger.

16:23.290 --> 16:27.710
I needed power to take everything back.

16:29.540 --> 16:31.920
You sure are courageous.

16:31.920 --> 16:36.080
You may be a good soldier
for world domination.

16:46.960 --> 16:50.790
I... You...

16:51.670 --> 16:57.290
You may have done your best for Aruka
and the Warblades in your own way.

16:57.630 --> 17:01.210
However, you're putting your effort
towards the wrong things.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.960
Nelia, move.

17:05.960 --> 17:07.960
Repent what you have done.

17:15.000 --> 17:16.500
Seems we have a winner.

17:16.500 --> 17:18.460
That was unfair!

17:18.460 --> 17:20.630
How am I to fight a power like that?!

17:20.630 --> 17:22.960
You don't even have a plan, do you?!

17:29.790 --> 17:33.290
You have ridiculed Gerra-Aruka
since the very beginning!

17:33.290 --> 17:36.170
Do you think that as long as you have
Terakomari Gandesblood's power,

17:36.170 --> 17:38.670
the Warblades are no match for you?!

17:40.040 --> 17:42.040
Well, Madhart.

17:42.040 --> 17:44.830
We are aiming for world domination.

17:46.040 --> 17:50.960
That said, unlike you, this isn't to give all
the world's military power to one person,

17:50.960 --> 17:56.210
but to create an ideal world
where people can help one another.

17:56.210 --> 17:58.960
That is the purpose of the Mulnite Empire.

17:58.960 --> 18:01.920
Pointless. Very obviously unachievable.

18:01.920 --> 18:05.460
People are living beings who can
think of nothing other than themselves.

18:05.460 --> 18:07.210
Komari is different.

18:07.210 --> 18:12.540
Her purpose is to guide the people's
hearts in the correct direction.

18:12.540 --> 18:14.380
Are you messing with me?!

18:14.380 --> 18:17.830
For instance, that "Moonpeach Princess"
was saved by Komari.

18:17.830 --> 18:20.580
People whose hearts have been
changed by Komari

18:20.580 --> 18:25.460
will go on to forget the asinine idea of
subjugating others through power.

18:25.460 --> 18:32.380
If there are more people like that,
our country will achieve that ideal, perhaps.

18:32.380 --> 18:35.040
With that girl alone?!

18:35.040 --> 18:37.210
She's bringing it to an end now.

18:48.170 --> 18:50.380
That can't possibly...

18:50.380 --> 18:51.580
It will happen.

18:51.580 --> 18:54.830
Give it up, Mr. President.

19:27.710 --> 19:29.750
Since the end of the Great Six Nations War,

19:29.750 --> 19:33.380
President Madhart has gone missing,

19:33.380 --> 19:38.750
and a new presidential election will be
held in the Republic of Gerra-Aruka.

19:42.790 --> 19:44.580
What's going on?

19:44.580 --> 19:46.630
Tell your big sister about it.

19:48.210 --> 19:51.040
The goddess is upset with me.

19:55.000 --> 19:57.290
Don't you know, Amatsu?

19:57.290 --> 20:00.790
Inverse Moon has no mercy for
those who have failed.

20:00.790 --> 20:02.580
It's off with your head, my friend!

20:02.580 --> 20:05.380
No, this operation was a huge success.

20:05.380 --> 20:08.330
Hey, wait, don't eat my taiyaki...

20:08.330 --> 20:11.630
But your operation was a huge success?

20:11.630 --> 20:15.880
Our objective was to eliminate Gerra-Aruka.

20:16.880 --> 20:18.880
This is the first I'm hearing of it.

20:19.290 --> 20:22.210
The goddess couldn't pardon Madhart,

20:22.210 --> 20:26.080
because with the Dark Core's
infinite regeneration ability,

20:26.080 --> 20:28.580
they were doing unspeakable
living-body experimentation.

20:28.580 --> 20:33.080
Since something like the Dark Core exists,
villainous deeds will happen.

20:34.130 --> 20:36.920
Sounds like something the goddess
would be angry with.

20:37.330 --> 20:41.170
We enticed Madhart with
a ritual article there as bait,

20:41.170 --> 20:43.750
and led him into an unwinnable war.

20:44.130 --> 20:48.000
Hm? Then why is the princess upset with you?

20:51.380 --> 20:54.500
She told me to cherish my family.

20:57.880 --> 21:00.420
It's been forever since I've come here.

21:01.880 --> 21:04.710
Lady Nelia, sorry I'm late.

21:04.710 --> 21:08.920
You are late, even though you're
the one who called me out here...

21:16.210 --> 21:17.630
Dad.

21:18.330 --> 21:19.330
Nelia...

21:24.670 --> 21:28.920
Dad, you're safe!
I'm sorry I couldn't save you!

21:28.920 --> 21:31.580
Oh no, you've done your best.

21:32.630 --> 21:36.920
You are a far more gallant
Warblade than even I.

21:37.290 --> 21:38.960
Dad...

21:46.130 --> 21:51.710
<b>One month later</b>

21:55.330 --> 21:56.750
Ha!

21:56.750 --> 21:58.710
Die!

21:58.710 --> 22:02.170
You Gerra-Arukan rust buckets!

22:02.750 --> 22:07.460
I will be the one to receive a head pat
from Her Excellency!

22:07.460 --> 22:08.580
Hey, you bastard!
I will be the one to receive a head pat<b>
</b>from Her Excellency!<b></b>

22:08.920 --> 22:10.170
That's my kill!

22:10.170 --> 22:13.460
Screw you! I found 'em first!

22:13.460 --> 22:16.130
I won't let you snatch it from me!

22:16.130 --> 22:17.460
Die!

22:22.290 --> 22:26.080
Please be happy, Lady Komari.
The enemy is currently dumbfounded.

22:26.080 --> 22:27.830
How could I be happy about that?!

22:28.630 --> 22:30.670
How did this happen...

22:30.670 --> 22:34.630
I thought Nelia and I had
a friendship of sorts...

22:34.630 --> 22:38.500
Perhaps, in order to get votes for
the upcoming presidential election,

22:38.500 --> 22:42.040
she wants to defeat you and
raise her reputation.

22:45.670 --> 22:47.710
I've finally arrived!

22:51.420 --> 22:54.880
Komari, be my servant.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.830
Are you serious?!

22:57.920 --> 22:59.790
Defy me if you wish to do so.

22:59.790 --> 23:03.960
However, there's a destiny that
you and I will embark on together.

23:04.380 --> 23:07.130
We are comrades who strive for world peace!

23:07.500 --> 23:11.750
With our combined strength,
we will fear no enemy!

23:12.130 --> 23:16.540
Are you getting cocky after just
a sip of Lady Komari's blood?

23:16.540 --> 23:17.960
I'm jealous...

23:18.250 --> 23:20.420
I'll wring your body like a dish rag

23:20.420 --> 23:23.040
and squeeze all of Lady Komari's
blood out of you.

23:23.040 --> 23:24.460
Yikes, Vill!

23:24.460 --> 23:26.830
I'm with Miss Villhaze!

23:29.960 --> 23:32.000
If we kill her...

23:32.000 --> 23:35.960
there will no longer be anyone in the world
who's had a drink of Miss Komari's blood.

23:35.960 --> 23:38.130
You're saying scary things
so calmly too, Sakuna?!

23:38.380 --> 23:39.460
Komari!

23:39.830 --> 23:41.380
Miss Komari!

23:41.670 --> 23:43.000
Lady Komari!

23:51.380 --> 23:52.500
Yeah...

23:52.500 --> 24:01.000
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

23:53.330 --> 23:55.540
I wanna be a shut-in.
